{"5069920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Asteroids Arena Online", "steam_appid": 5069920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faithful to the classic, but much more modern.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank movement combined with a zero-friction player. <i>(Good luck!)</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Waves Mode (Solo/Co-op)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive increasingly larger waves of asteroids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight various alien ships, including common enemies, special enemies, and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide variety of weapons and power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the shop every 5 waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to reach the top of the online leaderboards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Competitive Mode (1v1 PvP)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balanced competitive rules. <i>(Weapon balance is still a work in progress.)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your opponent among asteroids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn credits by destroying asteroids during the match and spend them in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use multiple weapons and power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All weapons and power-ups are obtained during the match. Every match starts with no equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matchmaking with an MMR ranking system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Server-based demos/replays are available for every match.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faithful to the classic, but much more modern.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank movement combined with a zero-friction player. <i>(Good luck!)</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Waves Mode (Solo/Co-op)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive increasingly larger waves of asteroids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight various alien ships, including common enemies, special enemies, and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide variety of weapons and power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the shop every 5 waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to reach the top of the online leaderboards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Competitive Mode (1v1 PvP)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balanced competitive rules. <i>(Weapon balance is still a work in progress.)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your opponent among asteroids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn credits by destroying asteroids during the match and spend them in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use multiple weapons and power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All weapons and power-ups are obtained during the match. Every match starts with no equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matchmaking with an MMR ranking system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Server-based demos/replays are available for every match.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "-Fight others in PvP with movement and physics of a classic. -Survive SOLO or COOP in waves mode. -Use different weapons and powerups to survive. -Get to top of leaderboards", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069920/d5001bd78ba49809ba8e97fbb9e8e3b3fc7502d0/header.jpg?t=1787140226", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069920/9722964576af11693511e67b90d5fc9a122d5c6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787140226", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5069920/972296